     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Doubt",
     "texto": [
      "To say that you are torn between doing something or not, use **-(으)ㄹ지 말지**: 가다 → **갈지 말지** (whether to go or not), 먹다 → **먹을지 말지** (whether to eat or not).",
      "파티에 **갈지 말지** 고민이에요 = I'm in two minds about whether to go to the party or not."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Not knowing",
     "texto": [
      "**-(으)ㄹ지 모르겠어요** says that you don't know whether something is going to happen.",
      "비가 올지 모르겠어요 = I don't know whether it will rain."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
